# Drift guard for the URLResourceProvider shadow.
#
# The URLResourceProvider.java sitting next to this file is a SHADOW of
# epubcheck's own com.adobe.epubcheck.util.URLResourceProvider: it is the
# upstream source copied verbatim, EXCEPT for the http(s) branch, which is
# rerouted through the JS host http bridge (ecshim.HostHttp). Non-http(s) URLs
# keep the original behavior verbatim. The shims jar precedes the epubcheck
# jars on the TeaVM compiler classpath, so our copy wins.
#
# WHAT THIS GUARDS
# The line below is the sha256 of the PRISTINE upstream URLResourceProvider.java
# (no http(s) rerouting) for the epubcheck version the shadow was last ported
# from. At build time scripts/check-shadow-drift.ts pulls that same file out of
# the epubcheck-<version>-sources.jar and hashes it. If epubcheck changed the
# file in a version bump, the hashes differ and the build FAILS loudly --
# otherwise our shadow would silently keep the OLD upstream behavior (e.g. a
# stale openStream flow) while pretending to be the new epubcheck.
#
# WHAT TO DO ON A MISMATCH
# 1. Diff the new upstream file against our shadow:
#      unzip -p build/epubcheck-<version>-sources.jar \
#        com/adobe/epubcheck/util/URLResourceProvider.java > /tmp/upstream.java
#      diff /tmp/upstream.java \
#        teavm/shims/src-teavm/com/adobe/epubcheck/util/URLResourceProvider.java
#    (our shadow only changes the http(s) branch and adds the doc comment; any
#     OTHER difference is a real upstream change.)
# 2. Re-port: start from the NEW upstream source and re-apply ONLY the http(s)
#    HostHttp rerouting branch, plus the doc comment. Keep the rest
#    byte-for-byte upstream.
# 3. Replace the shadow file with that re-ported version.
# 4. Update the hash line below to the new upstream file's sha256, e.g.:
#      unzip -p build/epubcheck-<version>-sources.jar \
#        com/adobe/epubcheck/util/URLResourceProvider.java | shasum -a 256
#
# epubcheck version the hash below is for: 5.3.0
2829d891ba2f353ed7e7d352838466d94a4c5b651dc4118d76cc2455c334b07c
